1
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,729
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,729 --> 00:01:45,900
[Episode 24]

4
00:01:46,509 --> 00:01:47,310
Zexi.

5
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:48,039
Yes, Your Highness.

6
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:49,430
Make sure the Golden Dragon Pavilion
is completely surrounded.

7
00:01:49,430 --> 00:01:50,509
If there are enemies,

8
00:01:50,509 --> 00:01:51,430
take them all down.

9
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:51,950
Yes.

10
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,110
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

11
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,730
Shadow puppets?

12
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:14,640
These aren't like

13
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,310
the shadow puppets we usually see.

14
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:17,570
They're all soldiers.

15
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:23,560
Flat hands, flat feet,
a body flat as can be.

16
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,240
Shadow puppets!

17
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:28,630
-They are all shadow puppets!
-Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

18
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:29,660
[Embrace All, Integrate All]

19
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:29,730
Shadow puppets can kill!

20
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:31,210
-Is it
-These shadow puppets can kill!

21
00:02:31,210 --> 00:02:34,670
-a puppet performing shadow play,
-Attack! They are all fake!

22
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:40,000
-or a shadow puppet wearing human skin?
-Form ranks and counterattack!

23
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:36,040
[Embrace All, Integrate All]

24
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,850
Zhenzhu,

25
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,840
go to the Yunding Pavilion
and guard the Grand Heir Apparent.

26
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,800
Leave this to me.

27
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,430
Okay.

28
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,310
Why are

29
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:15,030
our own people fighting each other?

30
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:15,840
Oh no,

31
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,490
it's Liluo's illusion technique.

32
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,760
The Dark Night is behind this again.

33
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:23,000
[God of Calamity, Qiuyu]

34
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:25,560
The God of Calamity,

35
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:26,960
Qiuyu...

36
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,770
Stop, all of you!

37
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:03,520
Shadow puppet monster!

38
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,040
The spirit channels flow;

39
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,040
yin and yang shift unpredictably—

40
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,830
break!

41
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,830
Mr. Yan.

42
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,159
Jiuying?

43
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,610
Are you alright?

44
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,730
How are you, buddy?

45
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,130
Quick, get a physician!

46
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:52,920
Come on.

47
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,430
Li Si?

48
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:55,030
Help me carry him over there.

49
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,860
Lord Constable Ghost.

50
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,600
Li Si.

51
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,780
You always said

52
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,600
when the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

53
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,600
someone must die.

54
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,430
Yet now

55
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,190
I'm standing right in front of you,

56
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,360
perfectly well.

57
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,430
Since

58
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:34,480
I didn't die

59
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,010
by your Severe-Cold Sword,

60
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:37,430
that proves

61
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:39,110
it's not

62
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,940
a cold-blooded killing weapon.

63
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,830
Am I right?

64
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,040
Ever since you appeared,

65
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,020
the prophecy of this sword

66
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,830
doesn't seem to
come true as often anymore.

67
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,830
This is

68
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,860
the will of heaven,

69
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,130
the law of cause and effect—

70
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,160
and you and I

71
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,000
are no different.

72
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:13,800
Li Si.

73
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:14,920
Qingyang?

74
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,800
Meng.

75
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,480
Meng Rui?

76
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,600
I truly never imagined it.

77
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,180
To think

78
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:31,370
I almost took a sword strike from you.

79
00:06:31,430 --> 00:06:33,760
Thank goodness Qingyang arrived in time.

80
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,720
Sir.

81
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:43,750
Sir, your skill is extraordinary.

82
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:45,409
You've resolved this crisis.

83
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,310
May I ask your name?

84
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,050
Third Brother,

85
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,760
you didn't recognize me after all.

86
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,230
This subject,

87
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,040
Divine Constable Li Qingyang

88
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,840
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

89
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:04,900
pays his respects
to Your Highness Prince Ping.

90
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:09,340
So you're

91
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:12,690
Divine Constable Qingyang,
famous in the capital.

92
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,720
Yes, that's me.

93
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:17,750
Good.

94
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,560
Our Great Shi Dynasty

95
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,120
truly teems with talent.

96
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:25,310
Constable Ghost Meng Rui
of the Divine Constable Bureau

97
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:27,920
-pays his respects to Your Highness.
-Greetings, Your Highness.

98
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,720
Thanks to

99
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,800
your Bureau being here tonight,

100
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,120
Liluo's evil plot was thwarted.

101
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:35,120
You've rendered great service
in protecting us.

102
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:35,980
Your Highness!

103
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,950
Greetings, Your Highness.

104
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:40,920
How is the Grand Heir Apparent?

105
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,750
Rest assured, Your Highness.

106
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,390
His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent
is safe and sound.

107
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,800
Take me to Lord Huo immediately.

108
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,480
Yes.

109
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:51,610
Your Highness.

110
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,430
Li Si.

111
00:07:58,190 --> 00:07:59,000
Meng Rui.

112
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,190
You're both here.

113
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,800
That's great.

114
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,260
Look how happy Zhenzhu is.

115
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,390
Still,

116
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,430
it seems we have tonight's crisis

117
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,830
to thank for bringing us,

118
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:12,380
the Four Divine Constables, back together.

119
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,190
Qingyang,

120
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:14,800
you have no idea

121
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,230
how we've managed to

122
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:18,810
get through the days without you.

123
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,090
I know

124
00:08:25,130 --> 00:08:26,240
you must all

125
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:28,750
have a lot of questions about me.

126
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:29,560
But

127
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,720
the most important thing right now

128
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,440
is to solve this case.

129
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:34,909
I'll explain

130
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:37,030
everything later.

131
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:39,159
Divine Constables!

132
00:08:39,789 --> 00:08:40,600
Bad news!

133
00:08:41,549 --> 00:08:42,480
General Sui Bing

134
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,700
was killed by the shadow puppets.

135
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:46,630
What did you say?

136
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,630
Where is the body now?

137
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,460
In the Langyue Studio.

138
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:55,560
[Langyue Studio]

139
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,150
General!

140
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,130
Don't touch him!

141
00:09:14,790 --> 00:09:16,630
Who was the first to discover the body?

142
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:17,440
I was.

143
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,750
When the shadow puppets
began their rampage,

144
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:22,320
and there was no sign of the General,

145
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,790
I sent someone here to look for him.

146
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:25,050
But I didn't expect...

147
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:27,390
I'd seen the General

148
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:29,550
patrolling the Tongtian Pavilion earlier.

149
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:31,240
Why did he come back to
the Langyue Studio?

150
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,170
The General said

151
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:34,440
he was coming back to get something.

152
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,440
When was that?

153
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,960
Not long after the General left,

154
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,560
the lunar eclipse occurred.

155
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,960
How long is "not long"?

156
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,600
About an hour.

157
00:09:48,510 --> 00:09:49,320
What did you find?

158
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:49,960
Same as

159
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,150
the previous 9 victims.

160
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:53,240
Sui Bing had a penetrating wound
on the side of his neck

161
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,970
and died of massive blood loss.

162
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:57,000
What about his internal organs?

163
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,630
His heart and liver

164
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:01,720
were both gone.

165
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,910
Looks like

166
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:08,630
the rumors going around town
aren't completely baseless.

167
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:10,390
How exactly did our General die?

168
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:11,030
Could it really be

169
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,390
as the townspeople say,

170
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:14,200
that the shadow puppet ghost
took his life?

171
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,000
I heard

172
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,390
that the ghost needs to collect

173
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:17,990
81 sets of hearts and livers.

174
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,270
Could this be connected to
Liluo's Dark Night?

175
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,080
Sui Bing might've been

176
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,000
caught in the illusion like us

177
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,260
and killed by mistake.

178
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:27,440
The incident in Gutan County

179
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,240
is most likely
the work of Liluo's Dark Night.

180
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,970
However, there seems to be more

181
00:10:31,750 --> 00:10:33,150
to Sui Bing's death.

182
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,390
We all saw it just now.

183
00:10:35,550 --> 00:10:36,960
The illusion technique makes

184
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,960
those caught in it kill one another.

185
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:41,120
Yet Sui Bing died

186
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,440
in the same manner
as the previous 9 victims.

187
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,700
How do we explain that?

188
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,440
Yan makes a fair point.

189
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:50,120
Sui Bing didn't die from the illusion,

190
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,530
yet it doesn't seem to be

191
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,550
the work of the killer who murdered

192
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:55,810
the previous 9 either,

193
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:56,720
because

194
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,750
the method is different.

195
00:10:58,910 --> 00:11:00,170
The previous 9 victims

196
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,320
were all

197
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,910
hung up

198
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,110
like shadow puppets.

199
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:06,550
The killer went to such lengths,

200
00:11:06,550 --> 00:11:09,120
so there must be a deeper motive.

201
00:11:10,910 --> 00:11:12,570
But why wasn't Sui Bing's body

202
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,550
hung up?

203
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:16,960
I agree with Li Si.

204
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,320
Although the wound
on the side of Sui Bing's neck

205
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:18,970
looks

206
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:20,240
the same as the previous victims',

207
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,000
if you look closely, you'll find

208
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,630
the edges of the wound
are smooth and even,

209
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:24,550
unlike theirs.

210
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:26,260
It looks more like someone
pierced his neck with a sharp weapon

211
00:11:26,260 --> 00:11:27,720
to mimic that appearance.

212
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,950
Another copycat crime.

213
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:31,340
Interesting.

214
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:34,000
The shadow puppet ghost
copied Yin Jie's method,

215
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,600
and whoever killed Sui Bing

216
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:37,840
copied the ghost's.

217
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,910
Are we overthinking this?

218
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:41,940
Liluo

219
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,960
broke into
the Golden Dragon Pavilion tonight.

220
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,890
They're still our prime suspects.

221
00:11:45,910 --> 00:11:47,320
If it really was the Dark Night,

222
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,240
their target

223
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:50,500
should've been the Grand Heir Apparent.

224
00:11:52,030 --> 00:11:52,910
General Ji.

225
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:53,720
Yes.

226
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,840
Please have
the men of the Xuanjie Battalion

227
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:58,320
search every inch of the Langyue Studio,

228
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,200
inside and out, top to bottom.

229
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,750
If you find anything

230
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:02,960
unusual,

231
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,400
let us know immediately.

232
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,200
Okay,

233
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,360
I'll see to it now.

234
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:10,450
You think there's something wrong
with this building?

235
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,000
"The dragon lies hidden in the deep;

236
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,730
its depths are unfathomable."

237
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,190
I suspect

238
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:22,840
there's more
to this vast Golden Dragon Pavilion

239
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,150
than meets the eye.

240
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,150
Anyway,

241
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:29,440
you and Meng Rui are back with us.

242
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,320
Everything

243
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,550
will be easier to handle.

244
00:12:31,550 --> 00:12:32,480
Right, Zhenzhu?

245
00:12:34,150 --> 00:12:35,880
Let's go downstairs and check.

246
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,980
Osmanthus wine.

247
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:49,120
I know this.

248
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,200
Lots of taverns in town sell it.

249
00:12:50,540 --> 00:12:52,000
[Osmanthus Wine]

250
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,160
A tavern owner

251
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,030
once spent ages telling me all about it.

252
00:12:54,030 --> 00:12:55,190
So this must be

253
00:12:55,210 --> 00:12:57,000
the renowned aged brew of Gutan County.

254
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,200
The osmanthus wine

255
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,390
does taste quite good.

256
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:00,240
And it's

257
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,550
only authentic

258
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:02,790
when sold in a crystal-clear jug

259
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:03,840
like this.

260
00:13:04,390 --> 00:13:05,360
I smelled this same scent

261
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,440
upstairs just now.

262
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,200
I get it.

263
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:15,150
After the killer murdered Sui Bing,

264
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,200
he saw

265
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:18,030
a bottle of osmanthus wine on the table,

266
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:19,630
and the craving got the better of him.

267
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:21,320
He couldn't resist the temptation,

268
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,320
so he took the wine

269
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,790
with him as he fled.

270
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,790
But he was so nervous

271
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,390
that as soon as he got downstairs,

272
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:29,200
he accidentally dropped it
and smashed it here.

273
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:29,910
Well...

274
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,630
Two bottles?

275
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,030
Then the killer
took 2 bottles of osmanthus wine.

276
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:37,290
The pavilion has rules

277
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,570
against eating meat

278
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,660
and drinking wine.

279
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,750
Sui Bing even

280
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:42,840
made a huge scene
at the Department of Food Affairs

281
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,840
over it.

282
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:45,200
I also took note

283
00:13:45,050 --> 00:13:47,070
[Langyue Studio]

284
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:47,390
when Sui Bing moved into

285
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,240
the Langyue Studio that night.

286
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,390
There was no wine

287
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:51,910
with his meal.

288
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:55,440
Sui Bing was clearly

289
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:57,450
wary of the pavilion's rules.

290
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,070
If these 2 bottles of wine

291
00:13:59,070 --> 00:14:00,670
really belonged to Sui Bing,

292
00:14:00,790 --> 00:14:02,350
and he was a heavy drinker,

293
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:04,960
why didn't he open
and drink them right away?

294
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,740
Yet the stoppers are still

295
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:10,000
firmly in place, even now.

296
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,000
Therefore,

297
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,320
these 2 bottles

298
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,630
were meant to

299
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:21,440
be given to him by someone else.

300
00:14:21,210 --> 00:14:29,460
[Langyue Studio]

301
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,550
Tonight, the entire Xuanjie Battalion

302
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:25,810
was sent to guard the Tongtian Pavilion,

303
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,840
so no one was posted

304
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,320
at the Langyue Studio.

305
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:32,720
It was the perfect chance
to sneak in and deliver the wine.

306
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,120
But right at that moment,

307
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:36,450
a lunar eclipse occurred.

308
00:14:36,550 --> 00:14:38,440
Liluo seized the opportunity
to wreak havoc,

309
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,840
and the shadow puppets suddenly appeared.

310
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,630
What that person didn't expect

311
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:44,630
was that Sui Bing
had already been murdered by then.

312
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:46,630
So, in his panic,

313
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:47,790
he fled,

314
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:49,240
leaving the wine behind.

315
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:52,320
According to your theory,

316
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:53,810
before we arrived

317
00:14:53,810 --> 00:14:55,120
at the crime scene,

318
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,000
there should've been a 3rd person there

319
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,200
besides Sui Bing and the killer.

320
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,790
If we find the 3rd person,

321
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,750
we may be able to determine

322
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,200
Sui Bing's exact time of death.

323
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:07,240
Sui Bing was transferred here
on short notice.

324
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,440
He was new to the area.

325
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:10,120
Someone who knew he loved wine

326
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:10,910
and was willing to risk

327
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,640
breaking the pavilion's rules

328
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,720
to sneak him some...

329
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:16,960
Someone with
that kind of friendship with him here...

330
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,120
The magistrate of Gutan County,

331
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,600
-Du Zhongtao.
-Mr. Sui!

332
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,000
Yan,

333
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,440
Meng Rui, Zhenzhu,

334
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,000
I'll leave Du Zhongtao

335
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,000
to you.

336
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,000
I want to go back
to the Department of Food Affairs

337
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,000
to see if I can

338
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,440
find any new clues.

339
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,120
My Lord, I'm innocent.

340
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,630
I'm innocent, My Lord!

341
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,600
How are things out there?

342
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,360
Minister,

343
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,390
the search is complete.

344
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:43,000
All of the Dark Night's forces

345
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,790
have been driven out of the pavilion.

346
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:45,750
The Yulin Army is also

347
00:15:45,750 --> 00:15:48,680
pursuing the fleeing remnants
with all their might.

348
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:50,680
Liluo has stirred up chaos,

349
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,150
and Sui Bing has been murdered.

350
00:15:52,150 --> 00:15:54,210
His Highness Prince Ping is furious!

351
00:15:54,510 --> 00:15:55,440
I've already urgently requested

352
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,000
the Yulin Army to enter the pavilion.

353
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,790
I said long ago that

354
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,630
this whole business
about shadow puppets killing people

355
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:01,810
was clearly a cover for someone

356
00:16:01,810 --> 00:16:02,750
plotting evil!

357
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:03,870
Liluo

358
00:16:03,870 --> 00:16:06,320
has never given up
their desire to destroy our country.

359
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,200
And now,

360
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,320
they've openly targeted
the Grand Heir Apparent.

361
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,720
It's utterly heinous!

362
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:11,840
Du Zhongtao!

363
00:16:12,750 --> 00:16:13,550
My Lord.

364
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:15,790
How exactly did Sui Bing die?

365
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,400
Confess truthfully!

366
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:18,360
My Lord,

367
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:19,750
I really don't know.

368
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:21,120
I'm innocent.

369
00:16:21,390 --> 00:16:23,060
I... I only knew...

370
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:24,270
knew that Sui Bing loved wine,

371
00:16:24,270 --> 00:16:25,390
so... so I thought I'd

372
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,510
secretly bring him some

373
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,780
to... to drink with him.

374
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:28,440
But I never imagined...

375
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,390
I never imagined I'd run into

376
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:30,770
the shadow puppet ghost causing trouble.

377
00:16:30,770 --> 00:16:32,000
By... By the time I went up to

378
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
the top floor of the Langyue Studio,

379
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,600
General Sui...

380
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,030
General Sui was already dead.

381
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:36,240
Sui Bing, this is bad!

382
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,030
The vengeful shadow puppet ghost...

383
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:37,840
The vengeful shadow puppet ghost...

384
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,030
Sui Bing, Sui...

385
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:48,550
My Lord.

386
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:50,720
It must've been the shadow puppet ghost

387
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,650
that killed him.

388
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:52,840
Sui Bing's heart and liver

389
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,200
must've been dug out too,

390
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,000
right?

391
00:16:59,550 --> 00:17:00,360
Right?

392
00:17:03,550 --> 00:17:04,720
Didn't I say so?

393
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,400
Didn't I say so?

394
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,829
It was Yin Jie's vengeful spirit

395
00:17:07,829 --> 00:17:08,690
who killed him.

396
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:09,960
It wasn't me.

397
00:17:10,109 --> 00:17:11,710
It really wasn't me, My Lord!

398
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,640
Since you found the body,

399
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,440
why didn't you report it immediately?

400
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,920
I was scared out of my wits at the time.

401
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:18,440
I just figured

402
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:20,569
I wasn't the one who killed him anyway.

403
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:21,839
A-And now that

404
00:17:21,869 --> 00:17:22,880
the Divine Constables are here,

405
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,280
they will definitely find the real killer.

406
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:28,000
Better to avoid trouble
when you can, right?

407
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,510
As the magistrate of Gutan County,

408
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,750
you're so cowardly!

409
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:31,790
My Lord, please spare me.

410
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:32,960
Please spare me, My Lord.

411
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,750
My Lord...

412
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,000
Once the blessing ceremony is over,

413
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:39,160
I'll make you answer for this.

414
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:40,240
Get out!

415
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:53,830
Minister.

416
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,240
I'm fine.

417
00:18:00,310 --> 00:18:01,440
Regarding the chaos

418
00:18:01,550 --> 00:18:03,440
caused by the Liluo remnants tonight,

419
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,920
the Grand Heir Apparent
has made his position clear.

420
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:08,160
He wants us never to be cowed
by such acts of violence

421
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:10,090
and to eradicate evil completely.

422
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,960
Also,

423
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:14,200
the rite of beseeching heaven
and the blessing ceremony

424
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,830
must proceed as planned.

425
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:18,350
Ji Xun of the Xuanjie Battalion,

426
00:18:18,350 --> 00:18:20,280
you'll serve as acting commander.

427
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,170
I, Ji Xun, accept the order.

428
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,920
What Du Zhongtao said

429
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,000
proves that Li Si's deduction

430
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:33,920
is correct.

431
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:34,960
That means

432
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:37,000
Sui Bing actually died

433
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:37,840
when Liluo

434
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:39,000
started manipulating the shadow puppets

435
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,200
to cause chaos,

436
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,640
or even earlier.

437
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:42,590
If the killer really was

438
00:18:42,590 --> 00:18:43,640
Liluo's Dark Night,

439
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,400
that would explain the motive.

440
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:47,000
Even if they couldn't kill
the Grand Heir Apparent,

441
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,920
killing the general

442
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,960
responsible for his protection

443
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,690
would remove a major obstacle.

444
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:51,830
Exactly.

445
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:53,550
But there is one thing
that doesn't add up.

446
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,510
Once they killed him,

447
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,590
their objective was achieved.

448
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:57,160
Why still cut out his heart and liver?

449
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,760
Didn't we just analyze that?

450
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,000
To imitate the earlier killings

451
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,720
and blame it on the shadow puppet ghost.

452
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:03,000
That's exactly the bizarre part of

453
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,000
Sui Bing's death.

454
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,720
As they say, if you're going to
put on a show, do it right.

455
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:07,000
If it was a copycat crime,

456
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,720
why did they have time
to take out his heart and liver

457
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,530
but not enough time

458
00:19:09,530 --> 00:19:11,000
to hang up the body?

459
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,160
I think so too.

460
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:15,480
Let's wait and see

461
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,790
what Li Si can find out.

462
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:18,240
I want to go back to the Langyue Studio

463
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:19,180
and take Sui Bing's body

464
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:20,170
to the county office

465
00:19:20,170 --> 00:19:21,770
for a thorough examination.

466
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:23,110
It's closer if we cut through

467
00:19:23,110 --> 00:19:24,030
Tinghe Pond.

468
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:24,920
Let's go.

469
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:25,590
Let's go.

470
00:19:28,870 --> 00:19:31,910
[Department of Food Affairs]

471
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,110
Nothing like last night

472
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,750
has happened
since the Golden Dragon Pavilion

473
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:35,310
was built!

474
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:36,510
Were there assassins?

475
00:19:36,510 --> 00:19:37,830
Not assassins.

476
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:39,200
It was the vengeful shadow puppet ghost

477
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:41,550
coming to the Golden Dragon Pavilion
for revenge!

478
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:42,510
That eerie?

479
00:19:42,510 --> 00:19:43,520
I heard

480
00:19:43,590 --> 00:19:45,160
that Yin Jie

481
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:48,000
was eaten by the Dragon King himself.

482
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:50,830
Xiaoshan,

483
00:19:51,310 --> 00:19:52,790
did you really see it?

484
00:19:52,790 --> 00:19:54,400
"See it"?

485
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,240
It flew right over my head!

486
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:59,440
Blood was raining down from the sky.

487
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:01,000
Luckily, I reacted fast

488
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,110
and hid behind a rock.

489
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:03,400
Otherwise, I would've been caught

490
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:05,460
and had my heart and liver ripped out!

491
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:07,440
It seems the duties
at the Golden Dragon Pavilion

492
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,310
are too easy for you lot.

493
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,970
Be careful,

494
00:20:10,990 --> 00:20:12,750
or I'll have Lord Huo
pull out your tongues!

495
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:13,440
Just now,

496
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:15,160
this foolish servant
has spoken out of turn again.

497
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,690
Please forgive me, Eunuch.

498
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:20,960
Keep your mouths shut

499
00:20:21,590 --> 00:20:23,160
about what happened

500
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,590
last night.

501
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,240
Whoever dares to leak a single word

502
00:20:27,350 --> 00:20:28,760
will be beheaded!

503
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,830
-Yes.
-Yes.

504
00:20:35,510 --> 00:20:38,720
This is what the Grand Heir Apparent
left over from last night.

505
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:39,960
Hurry up and take it.

506
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:44,000
Get back to work, all of you.

507
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,510
Let's go.

508
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:45,750
Let's go.

509
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:46,920
Let me.

510
00:21:31,620 --> 00:21:36,880
[Upright and Impartial]

511
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:32,310
He's coming?

512
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,040
He's coming!

513
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:27,310
We can finally work on cases

514
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:30,280
together again.

515
00:22:41,270 --> 00:22:42,070
Yan.

516
00:22:52,110 --> 00:22:53,440
Mr. Yan, are you okay?

517
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,310
What?

518
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,790
I... D-Don't follow me.

519
00:22:58,110 --> 00:22:58,920
I must say,

520
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,010
Sanhuo is indeed

521
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:02,310
the happiest one...

522
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:06,110
in our Divine Constable Bureau.

523
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,510
I...

524
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:27,680
Looks like Zhenzhu guessed right.

525
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:29,640
It really was the Chief who saved you.

526
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:31,240
And you kept us in the dark,

527
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,550
making us worry.

528
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:33,400
I didn't mean

529
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,460
to keep it from you.

530
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:35,620
It's just that

531
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:37,350
Li San and I

532
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:39,350
were master and disciple,

533
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:40,680
and he was from Liluo.

534
00:23:40,770 --> 00:23:41,640
I was worried

535
00:23:42,030 --> 00:23:43,030
his identity

536
00:23:43,350 --> 00:23:44,750
might put you all at risk.

537
00:23:45,070 --> 00:23:45,880
Li Si,

538
00:23:46,070 --> 00:23:47,870
what exactly is your connection

539
00:23:48,030 --> 00:23:49,400
to Li San and Liluo?

540
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,510
Li San saved me

541
00:23:53,030 --> 00:23:54,200
when I was a child.

542
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:57,000
He also taught me

543
00:23:57,350 --> 00:23:58,720
everything I know.

544
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,790
To me,

545
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,790
he was like a second father.

546
00:24:03,270 --> 00:24:04,440
That's all.

547
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,440
However,

548
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:08,670
I, Li Si, have never done

549
00:24:08,670 --> 00:24:10,160
anything atrocious,

550
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,730
nor have I aided evildoers.

551
00:24:12,270 --> 00:24:13,400
Liluo and I

552
00:24:14,030 --> 00:24:15,350
are enemies, not friends.

553
00:24:15,350 --> 00:24:16,160
See?

554
00:24:16,230 --> 00:24:17,400
I told you so.

555
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:21,440
Zhenzhu,

556
00:24:21,790 --> 00:24:22,640
how is it?

557
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,460
Do you know what exactly is

558
00:24:24,460 --> 00:24:25,460
on this?

559
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:27,200
It should be

560
00:24:27,590 --> 00:24:29,320
scales from an insect's wings.

561
00:24:29,790 --> 00:24:30,590
Chiying bugs?

562
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:31,750
No.

563
00:24:32,470 --> 00:24:33,330
It's a bug

564
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,840
with beautiful wings.

565
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:36,750
A butterfly?

566
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,860
That actually could be it.

567
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:45,440
Butterflies are attracted to sweet things.

568
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,750
And the Grand Heir Apparent's meals

569
00:24:47,790 --> 00:24:49,030
include many desserts,

570
00:24:49,030 --> 00:24:50,400
like sweet milk curd.

571
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:51,640
Perhaps

572
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:53,640
they were drawn by the scent

573
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,790
on the chopsticks.

574
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,550
But where would we find butterflies

575
00:24:56,550 --> 00:24:57,680
at this time of year?

576
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,160
Where indeed...

577
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:04,830
The gods grant blessings,

578
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:06,080
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

579
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,610
and the golden dragon brings good fortune,

580
00:25:06,610 --> 00:25:08,210
as we beseech heaven!

581
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:25,000
On the 13th day of the 11th month,

582
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,550
in the 37th year of Hongyun,

583
00:25:27,750 --> 00:25:29,400
Zhou Ye, the Grand Heir Apparent,

584
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:32,070
solemnly presents
this memorial to the heavens.

585
00:25:32,070 --> 00:25:34,350
At the winter solstice,

586
00:25:34,350 --> 00:25:35,750
the 6 vital energies renew.

587
00:25:35,750 --> 00:25:37,240
In solemn observance of the ancient rites,

588
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,880
I respectfully lead my officials

589
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:42,590
in presenting jade, silk, livestock,
grain, and other offerings,

590
00:25:42,590 --> 00:25:44,000
preparing incense and sacrificial fires

591
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:46,110
to worship the heavens.

592
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:48,240
For such an important ceremony

593
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:50,130
as the rite of beseeching heaven,

594
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,440
why has Abbot Yun Hai

595
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:52,590
still not appeared?

596
00:25:53,750 --> 00:25:56,240
The Abbot has been
in seclusion for 20 years.

597
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:58,280
If he doesn't wish to emerge,

598
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:00,640
there is little we can do.

599
00:26:12,030 --> 00:26:14,850
Set the dragon lanterns aloft!

600
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:48,750
Look! Look!

601
00:26:48,830 --> 00:26:49,790
There are dragons!

602
00:26:49,790 --> 00:26:50,860
Where? Where?

603
00:26:51,890 --> 00:26:56,180
[Upright and Impartial]

604
00:26:52,750 --> 00:26:53,480
There really are!

605
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:54,070
Yeah.

606
00:26:54,070 --> 00:26:56,200
-There really are dragons.
-Dragons.

607
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,400
They look so lifelike!

608
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,260
Flying so high.

609
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:03,900
The rite of beseeching heaven has begun.

610
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:07,400
Now that the ceremony has started,

611
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,480
no one may wander freely

612
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:10,240
within the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

613
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:11,270
It will be even harder

614
00:27:11,270 --> 00:27:12,400
to investigate now.

615
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:15,000
The golden dragons bring good fortune.

616
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:16,000
They look so real.

617
00:27:16,550 --> 00:27:18,000
Look at you, so easily impressed.

618
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:20,330
Shows how little you've seen of the world!

619
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,830
If we can't investigate inside,

620
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,430
we'll investigate outside.

621
00:27:25,550 --> 00:27:26,350
Zhao Quan.

622
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:29,750
Sir,

623
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,310
you know me?

624
00:27:31,350 --> 00:27:32,590
Not only do I know you,

625
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:34,480
but I also know your magistrate.

626
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,030
Yes, yes.

627
00:27:36,350 --> 00:27:37,790
A friend of the Divine Constables

628
00:27:37,790 --> 00:27:38,480
is naturally a friend

629
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,550
of our magistrate.

630
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:40,920
Where is your magistrate?

631
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:41,810
Ever since the magistrate returned

632
00:27:41,810 --> 00:27:42,880
from the Golden Dragon Pavilion
last night,

633
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:44,400
he hasn't been feeling well.

634
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:46,460
He's resting in a side room right now.

635
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,750
Where is Mad Cripple, the man

636
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:51,000
you took away yesterday when we were

637
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,680
preparing for the blessing ceremony?

638
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,940
He's still being held.

639
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:55,240
Bring him here for questioning.

640
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:55,920
Yes.

641
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:56,750
Daquan, Erxiong,

642
00:27:56,750 --> 00:27:57,440
come with me!

643
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:58,110
Hurry!

644
00:27:58,160 --> 00:27:58,960
Okay.

645
00:28:05,550 --> 00:28:06,550
What's your name?

646
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,530
He's mad and raving.

647
00:28:09,530 --> 00:28:11,160
He's probably long forgotten who he is.

648
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:13,090
We all just call him "Mad Cripple."

649
00:28:13,830 --> 00:28:15,440
What are those in your hand?

650
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:17,400
May I have a look?

651
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:21,000
G-Give them to me.

652
00:28:22,270 --> 00:28:23,670
Just 2 worthless stones.

653
00:28:23,750 --> 00:28:24,830
When he was brought in,

654
00:28:24,830 --> 00:28:26,240
he wouldn't let go of them no matter what.

655
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,840
So we had to let him keep them.

656
00:28:28,270 --> 00:28:29,600
Covered with calluses.

657
00:28:32,550 --> 00:28:34,000
The calluses on your hands

658
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:35,830
come from operating shadow puppets,

659
00:28:35,830 --> 00:28:36,680
and your habit of

660
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,210
rolling stones in your palm

661
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:40,110
is for building up your hand strength.

662
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:40,920
So,

663
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:43,960
you're a shadow puppeteer.

664
00:28:45,830 --> 00:28:48,000
Twice you appeared on Panlong Street,

665
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:50,830
and each time you spoke of
the shadow puppet ghost.

666
00:28:50,830 --> 00:28:52,890
It's because you harbor resentment.

667
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,240
So,

668
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:57,660
you curse everyone,
believing they're wicked to the core.

669
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,270
You think everyone in the world

670
00:28:59,270 --> 00:29:00,640
has wronged you,

671
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:03,200
and you want to
rip out their hearts and livers

672
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:05,550
to avenge your dead wife and child.

673
00:29:06,780 --> 00:29:08,060
Am I right?

674
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,200
Yin Jie.

675
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,790
You killed 9 people

676
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,510
out of resentment.

677
00:29:24,830 --> 00:29:26,490
How can your conscience rest?

678
00:29:26,550 --> 00:29:27,640
He is Yin Jie?

679
00:29:28,350 --> 00:29:29,910
Didn't Yin Jie die a long time ago?

680
00:29:29,910 --> 00:29:31,030
I-I'm not Yin Jie.

681
00:29:31,030 --> 00:29:32,230
I didn't kill anyone.

682
00:29:32,590 --> 00:29:33,920
They killed them!

683
00:29:34,270 --> 00:29:35,400
They killed them!

684
00:29:35,550 --> 00:29:36,790
They killed them!

685
00:29:49,830 --> 00:29:51,630
Please, take a close look, sirs.

686
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:53,140
Do you recognize this man?

687
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:57,500
Well...

688
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:01,510
Isn't he

689
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:03,720
Gensheng, the boy
who lived on everyone's charity?

690
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:04,440
Yes, yes, yes.

691
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,080
He is Gensheng.

692
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,440
My Lords,

693
00:30:07,860 --> 00:30:09,640
this man is from our Yin Village.

694
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:10,840
His name is Gensheng.

695
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,230
He was orphaned at a young age,

696
00:30:12,230 --> 00:30:14,230
and the villagers helped raise him.

697
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,160
Later, he became an apprentice

698
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:18,210
and learned, uh, shadow puppetry.

699
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:19,920
Who was his master?

700
00:30:20,680 --> 00:30:23,200
The very one, Yin Jie,
the shadow puppet ghost.

701
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:25,030
Ever since that incident,

702
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:27,590
Gensheng has been missing too.

703
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,560
Looks like we need to find out

704
00:30:30,750 --> 00:30:32,640
what really happened 6 years ago.

705
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,400
Where are the remains of Yin Jie's family

706
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:37,000
buried now?

707
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,550
Since they were from Yin Village,

708
00:30:38,550 --> 00:30:39,470
they would naturally be buried

709
00:30:39,470 --> 00:30:40,930
in the village graveyard.

710
00:30:41,270 --> 00:30:42,400
But back then,

711
00:30:42,590 --> 00:30:44,030
the owner of Xiangrui

712
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,920
brought back
only the body of Yin Jie's wife,

713
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:47,030
Qin.

714
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:49,070
As for the body of his 3-year-old son,

715
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:49,750
well,

716
00:30:49,750 --> 00:30:51,590
we have no idea where it went.

717
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:53,410
Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop?

718
00:30:53,590 --> 00:30:54,400
That's right.

719
00:30:57,050 --> 00:30:58,540
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

720
00:30:57,790 --> 00:30:58,640
Shopkeeper Huang,

721
00:30:58,640 --> 00:31:00,040
do you still remember me?

722
00:31:02,400 --> 00:31:03,630
It's you.

723
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:05,110
I remember.

724
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:11,160
Yin Jie and I were old friends, in a way.

725
00:31:11,160 --> 00:31:13,200
He was a solitary man

726
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,640
and rarely associated with others.

727
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:15,720
Come to think of it,

728
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:17,550
if he were still alive,

729
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,360
we would've known each other

730
00:31:19,390 --> 00:31:20,320
for almost

731
00:31:20,340 --> 00:31:21,650
15 years by now.

732
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:26,310
Besides his wife and son,

733
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:28,550
did Yin Jie have anyone else
in his family?

734
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:31,200
An apprentice, perhaps?

735
00:31:31,310 --> 00:31:32,240
He actually did.

736
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:34,400
But that boy was an orphan.

737
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:36,440
Yin Jie never took apprentices,

738
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,830
but perhaps out of pity,

739
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:40,030
he took the boy in.

740
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,430
And the boy

741
00:31:41,460 --> 00:31:42,920
was indeed very talented.

742
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,750
In just a couple of years,

743
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:48,610
the shadow puppets he made
were quite respectable.

744
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:50,420
Master, when will you

745
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:52,570
teach me "The Magpie Bridge Reunion"?

746
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,580
When

747
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,010
you draw this old man

748
00:31:56,040 --> 00:31:57,610
nicely,

749
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,200
I'll teach you.

750
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:01,110
You little brat.

751
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:06,880
The show is starting!

752
00:32:09,830 --> 00:32:11,640
Yin Jie's best play

753
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:13,500
was "The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

754
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:15,400
When he and his wife
performed it together,

755
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:18,030
the audience would applaud in awe.

756
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:28,750
Yet, for all this time,

757
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:31,970
he hadn't taught Gensheng that very play.

758
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:33,340
Because of this,

759
00:32:33,750 --> 00:32:35,960
their relationship
as master and apprentice

760
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:37,420
gradually deteriorated.

761
00:33:01,030 --> 00:33:02,090
Shopkeeper Huang,

762
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:04,480
I wonder if we could invite your troupe

763
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:07,030
to make a trip to Yin Village with us.

764
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:19,660
Gensheng.

765
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,090
Gensheng?

766
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,550
Gensheng.

767
00:33:25,590 --> 00:33:26,790
You're back.

768
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:30,410
You haven't been back to visit
for a long time.

769
00:33:31,680 --> 00:33:32,700
Gensheng?

770
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:35,050
Gensheng!

771
00:33:42,030 --> 00:33:42,830
Gensheng.

772
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:45,200
Gensheng!

773
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,750
Gensheng.

774
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:57,830
Gensheng.

775
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:01,240
Gensheng!

776
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:30,480
♪ Far, far away shines the Cowherd Star ♪

777
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:33,920
♪ Bright is the Weaver Maid ♪

778
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:37,480
♪ Slender and delicate were her hands ♪

779
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:41,420
♪ Click-clack went her loom ♪

780
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:44,880
♪ All day she wove,
yet no pattern took shape ♪

781
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:48,260
♪ Tears streamed down her cheeks ♪

782
00:34:48,510 --> 00:34:51,920
♪ The Milky Way stretched
clear and shallow ♪

783
00:34:52,020 --> 00:34:57,150
♪ How far apart could the two shores be? ♪

784
00:35:03,550 --> 00:35:04,360
Gensheng,

785
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,400
why do you draw the fairy maiden

786
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,590
with such intricate lines

787
00:35:06,590 --> 00:35:07,760
but the old man

788
00:35:07,790 --> 00:35:08,890
with just a few strokes?

789
00:35:08,890 --> 00:35:10,800
The fairy maiden
will be played by Mrs. Yin,

790
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:12,760
so of course
she must be drawn beautifully.

791
00:35:12,760 --> 00:35:14,110
As for you, Master,

792
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,840
you're an old man both onstage and off.

793
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:17,100
A rough sketch will do.

794
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:18,800
Yu'er,

795
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:19,960
back me up here.

796
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:21,480
It's fitting that he compares you

797
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:22,710
to a fairy maiden.

798
00:35:23,070 --> 00:35:25,030
But why do I have to be the old man?

799
00:35:25,030 --> 00:35:26,400
You brat.

800
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:32,360
Master...

801
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:20,230
Gensheng,

802
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:23,260
what exactly happened

803
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,360
that night 6 years ago?

804
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,040
I don't know.

805
00:36:27,630 --> 00:36:29,380
I don't know.

806
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,550
You're lying.

807
00:36:31,670 --> 00:36:33,400
You know everything.

808
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:36,200
Yin Jie rarely associated with anyone.

809
00:36:36,230 --> 00:36:37,400
And no one

810
00:36:37,630 --> 00:36:38,830
would visit his house

811
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:41,000
in the middle of the night.

812
00:36:41,110 --> 00:36:42,960
Come on, have a bite.

813
00:36:47,590 --> 00:36:48,800
But now,

814
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:51,190
everyone in Gutan County knows

815
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,740
everything that happened

816
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:53,800
in this courtyard

817
00:36:53,810 --> 00:36:55,060
that night.

818
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,670
Papa is back.

819
00:36:56,800 --> 00:36:57,590
Coming.

820
00:37:04,710 --> 00:37:06,510
How did everyone come to know?

821
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,110
Unless

822
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:13,030
someone had been in this courtyard

823
00:37:13,510 --> 00:37:15,640
and witnessed everything firsthand.

824
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:20,760
Yin Jie wanted to avenge his wife and son

825
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:22,320
by killing the village ruffians.

826
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:24,030
But how did he know

827
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:26,480
who the culprits were?

828
00:37:27,710 --> 00:37:29,230
Who told him?

829
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:36,550
Gensheng,

830
00:37:37,070 --> 00:37:38,190
that night,

831
00:37:38,710 --> 00:37:40,000
you happened to hear your master's wife

832
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:41,990
crying for help from the room.

833
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,840
-But at that time,
-Let go of me!

834
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:45,460
you were too scared

835
00:37:45,670 --> 00:37:47,250
to go in and save her.

836
00:37:48,320 --> 00:37:49,510
Instead, you just watched

837
00:37:49,510 --> 00:37:50,550
those villains

838
00:37:51,230 --> 00:37:53,590
assault your master's wife.

839
00:37:59,030 --> 00:38:00,630
You saw everything.

840
00:38:01,670 --> 00:38:03,000
They violated

841
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:05,670
your master's wife

842
00:38:06,030 --> 00:38:08,340
and brutally murdered your master's

843
00:38:08,440 --> 00:38:10,480
3-year-old son.

844
00:38:11,190 --> 00:38:12,390
I didn't kill anyone.

845
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:13,940
I didn't kill them.

846
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:15,970
They did it.

847
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:17,680
I didn't kill anyone.

848
00:38:18,670 --> 00:38:19,480
They did it.

849
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:20,480
They killed them!

850
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:22,480
They were all filthy scoundrels,

851
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:23,540
wicked to the core!

852
00:38:23,670 --> 00:38:24,480
They deserved to die!

853
00:38:24,480 --> 00:38:25,030
They deserved to die...

854
00:38:25,030 --> 00:38:26,590
You didn't kill the family.

855
00:38:26,590 --> 00:38:27,960
The villains did.

856
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,840
So they all deserved to die.

857
00:38:31,030 --> 00:38:32,270
But is that really

858
00:38:32,840 --> 00:38:34,190
what happened?

859
00:38:37,670 --> 00:38:39,670
We've finished
examining the remains of Qin,

860
00:38:39,670 --> 00:38:40,960
Yin Jie's wife.

861
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:03,610
Although only her bones

862
00:39:03,620 --> 00:39:04,670
remain after all these years,

863
00:39:04,670 --> 00:39:05,980
the marks on them

864
00:39:06,010 --> 00:39:07,310
still show

865
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:09,030
multiple stab wounds

866
00:39:09,030 --> 00:39:10,710
to the ribs made by a sharp blade.

867
00:39:10,710 --> 00:39:12,840
However, those wounds
were not the cause of death.

868
00:39:12,840 --> 00:39:14,480
I carefully examined the throat.

869
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,480
The hyoid bone is fractured,

870
00:39:15,480 --> 00:39:16,320
clearly

871
00:39:16,350 --> 00:39:18,080
from forceful strangulation.

872
00:39:20,510 --> 00:39:22,040
She was strangled to death.

873
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,550
Gensheng,

874
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,970
now that it has come to this,

875
00:39:26,110 --> 00:39:27,670
what else do you have to say?

876
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:33,720
You resented your master

877
00:39:35,000 --> 00:39:36,150
for refusing to

878
00:39:36,150 --> 00:39:37,190
teach you

879
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:38,850
"The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

880
00:39:39,230 --> 00:39:40,030
So,

881
00:39:41,110 --> 00:39:42,910
you kept waiting for your chance

882
00:39:43,630 --> 00:39:44,840
to take the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl
shadow puppets

883
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:45,960
for yourself.

884
00:39:47,190 --> 00:39:48,630
Until that night...

885
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:52,440
Who are you?

886
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:53,510
Let go of me!

887
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:54,760
Let go!

888
00:39:55,670 --> 00:39:56,480
Let go!

889
00:39:56,590 --> 00:39:57,670
Let go of me!

890
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:14,250
Yin Jie won't

891
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:15,480
come after us for this, will he?

892
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:16,110
What's there to fear?

893
00:40:16,110 --> 00:40:16,840
What can a shadow puppeteer

894
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:17,880
do?

895
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:19,070
-Besides,
-Yeah.

896
00:40:19,070 --> 00:40:20,480
who would know it was us?

897
00:41:12,420 --> 00:41:13,970
[The Magpie Bridge Reunion Score]

898
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:25,760
Gensheng.

899
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:26,670
Gensheng,

900
00:41:26,670 --> 00:41:27,590
I'm begging you.

901
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:29,070
Please, please

902
00:41:29,070 --> 00:41:29,880
save me.

903
00:41:30,400 --> 00:41:31,440
Please.

904
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:32,810
If he won't pass it to me,

905
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:34,030
I'll take it myself!

906
00:41:34,710 --> 00:41:36,190
What secret technique

907
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:37,590
is hidden

908
00:41:37,590 --> 00:41:38,920
in this pair of puppets?

909
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:40,640
He wouldn't pass it on

910
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,110
because he was afraid I'd surpass him

911
00:41:42,110 --> 00:41:43,600
one day!

912
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,030
For years, I've bowed

913
00:41:45,030 --> 00:41:46,880
and scraped and let you order me around.

914
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:48,620
I've had enough!

915
00:41:48,710 --> 00:41:49,440
Let go!

916
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:51,190
Gensheng, please...

917
00:41:51,280 --> 00:41:52,070
Let go.

918
00:41:52,280 --> 00:41:53,250
Let go!

919
00:41:53,360 --> 00:41:54,110
No...

920
00:41:54,110 --> 00:41:55,110
I'm begging you.

921
00:41:55,110 --> 00:41:56,070
Please save me.

922
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,190
Gensheng...

923
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:04,510
Please,

924
00:42:04,510 --> 00:42:05,670
I'm begging you.

925
00:42:09,230 --> 00:42:10,380
You won't let go?

926
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:11,720
You won't let go, huh?

927
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:15,640
You won't let go, huh?

928
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:30,150
Afterward,

929
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:31,780
when the county office inventoried

930
00:42:31,780 --> 00:42:33,240
the victims' belongings,

931
00:42:34,070 --> 00:42:35,730
they naturally failed to find

932
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:38,170
that pair of shadow puppets you had taken.

933
00:42:38,670 --> 00:42:40,070
Now I just want to ask you,

934
00:42:40,670 --> 00:42:41,480
Gensheng.

935
00:42:42,590 --> 00:42:44,070
Did you find the secret

936
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:46,700
your master hid and refused to pass down?

937
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:51,930
Preparing the hide,

938
00:42:52,710 --> 00:42:53,840
scraping it smooth,

939
00:42:54,230 --> 00:42:56,230
drawing the design,
transferring it onto the hide,

940
00:42:56,230 --> 00:42:57,800
carving, coloring,

941
00:42:58,110 --> 00:42:59,910
conditioning, and assembling.

942
00:43:00,070 --> 00:43:01,670
What on earth was different?

943
00:43:03,440 --> 00:43:05,770
Actually, there was no difference at all.

944
00:43:05,920 --> 00:43:06,900
They were just

945
00:43:06,930 --> 00:43:09,280
a pair of ordinary shadow puppets.

946
00:43:10,070 --> 00:43:11,070
My master had long

947
00:43:11,070 --> 00:43:12,440
since taught me everything

948
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:14,400
he could.

949
00:43:17,110 --> 00:43:18,440
There was just one thing

950
00:43:19,200 --> 00:43:20,670
I couldn't understand.

951
00:43:21,030 --> 00:43:22,590
Why, of all plays, wouldn't he

952
00:43:22,590 --> 00:43:25,670
teach me "The Magpie Bridge Reunion"?

953
00:43:26,190 --> 00:43:27,000
Gensheng,

954
00:43:27,920 --> 00:43:30,280
do you think Yin Jie's
"The Magpie Bridge Reunion"

955
00:43:30,280 --> 00:43:30,880
was just about

956
00:43:30,880 --> 00:43:32,920
