of the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl?

957
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:34,590
You were too young back then.

958
00:43:34,670 --> 00:43:35,840
You hadn't yet experienced

959
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:37,800
