960
00:43:38,880 --> 00:43:40,840
You had no one to give your true love to,

961
00:43:40,840 --> 00:43:43,190
nor had you ever suffered the pain
of longing for someone!

962
00:43:43,190 --> 00:43:44,670
Without experiencing separation,

963
00:43:44,670 --> 00:43:46,600
how could you understand reunion?

964
00:43:46,920 --> 00:43:47,990
And how could you convey

965
00:43:47,990 --> 00:43:49,650
the true meaning of this song?

966
00:43:50,440 --> 00:43:51,590
Your master

967
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:53,850
wanted to wait until you were older

968
00:43:54,110 --> 00:43:55,320
and had experienced more of life

969
00:43:55,320 --> 00:43:57,190
before passing the play on to you!

970
00:44:09,400 --> 00:44:10,190
Yu'er.

971
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:11,800
I always feel

972
00:44:12,840 --> 00:44:13,590
that something is missing

973
00:44:13,590 --> 00:44:15,070
from this Weaver Girl.

974
00:44:16,070 --> 00:44:17,000
Let me see.

975
00:44:27,510 --> 00:44:28,440
I have an idea.

976
00:44:46,630 --> 00:44:47,550
Brilliant.

977
00:44:47,880 --> 00:44:48,670
Yu'er,

978
00:44:49,030 --> 00:44:50,000
you know what?

979
00:44:50,590 --> 00:44:52,590
Watching Gensheng grow up day by day

980
00:44:53,000 --> 00:44:54,590
fills my heart with joy.

981
00:44:55,670 --> 00:44:56,920
I'll pass on every skill

982
00:44:56,920 --> 00:44:58,070
I know,

983
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:01,260
including "The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

984
00:45:01,360 --> 00:45:02,160
In the future,

985
00:45:02,440 --> 00:45:03,590
our family

986
00:45:03,840 --> 00:45:05,640
will perform on stage together.

987
00:45:16,070 --> 00:45:17,030
Mrs. Yin...

988
00:45:47,440 --> 00:45:48,400
Master.

989
00:45:49,440 --> 00:45:50,610
Mrs. Yin...

990
00:45:51,840 --> 00:45:53,160
I...

991
00:45:54,070 --> 00:45:55,840
was wrong...

992
00:45:58,670 --> 00:45:59,840
Take him back to the county jail

993
00:45:59,840 --> 00:46:00,840
and deal with him according to the law.

994
00:46:00,840 --> 00:46:01,590
-Yes.
-Yes.

995
00:46:02,990 --> 00:46:03,800
Move!
